• Forgot <entry>@1 It stays in history but no longer applies. Forget takes effect from the next turn: no new read, root, digest or new thread admits the content. Content already delivered into a thread's conversation (including tool results, hook copies and compaction summaries of them) remains in that thread's history; start a new thread for a clean context. Run /memory refresh to update the list.
